  "claim_scope": "For an actual full source Frame/configuration and source-owned write operation, the original paid result is constant at the same registered source, while the own Type native receipt completes its faithful residual request. Their actual total oldPaid+nativeValue equals original raw evaluation at the updated registered input. A source-dependent decoder reads the supplied native current event, and the existing Intake.Lower installs this programme before emitting the target/root/whole/next. Its own selected birth writes Env=write(actual total) and retains both original stock callbacks. The fixed-R Unit constPair leaf directly reads back both coordinates S(p), even though its actual native residual is0. A scalar control proves native0, oldPaid(1,0), actual born Env(1,0) versus initial0, and a canonical next.",
