  "certified_machine_facts": [
    "All seventy-seven previously unsigned tracked Intake dependencies independently pass fresh trust0/warningAsError; their exact module set and source SHAs match the frozen requirement. All three candidate production sources and the original direct gate independently pass. No construction OLean supplies a certified dependency.",
    "All 1242 unaffected formal dependencies are reused only by exact recursive source/import/compiler/OLean/sidecar signatures from CP100 and its signed prerequisites. The generic Source graph has626 local modules and core627 with no domain imports. Pressure production has1322; direct gate1323. All1319 nonowned snapshots match current HEAD with zero deltas.",
    "The three candidate main OLeans are byte-identical to the frozen export after the independent fresh dependency rebuild. All eighty source/dependency receipts and the direct gate have exit0. The nineteen original direct example bodies are independently kernel checked in a private header-only/Controls-namespace clone.",
    "The generic core selected type/value/constructor/recursor closure contains10395 declarations; pressure71767; complete direct71823; source primitive71609. All nine printed mouths and the full logical graph use exactly std3; unsafe, partial, unresolved and sorryAx are zero. Every intended old paid/native/effect/inverse/before-emitter/receipt/next/stock/fixed-pair anchor is reachable.",
    "The producer takes only actual Frame, source cfg and write. oldPaid is actual actionResultAt.value at the original source occurrence; old_paid_const is generated by OwnerFree.Consumer.target_expression and old_paid_value by the original source_value. The completed constant is not a target supplied by the caller.",
    "nativeAt reads sourceCurrent.2 at the supplied occurrence index. The actual own Completion.receipt generates its inl settlement. Prefix.receipt_read preserves initial rawRead across the paid prefix, and completed_value returns that same registered native residual evaluation. No epoch or future selected value is closed into the programme constructor.",
    "updated_total proves oldPaid+nativeValue equals material.raw.eval at N.input(material).environment. native_effect and native_inverse consume the same exact increment/relation and canonical residual fibre. No source projection, pair coordinate or unit is dropped.",
    "The source-dependent decoder reads the supplied current event and ignores the independent outer query tuple. born_environment identifies that current event with the actual selected event and consumes the receipt action=inl equation. The paid fallback0 is unused by birth; actual paid ticks retain mathNext.",
    "Existing Intake.Lower.state/generatedAction directly consumes this source-owned programme before target emission. source_target_root/next, source_compiles and original firstDestination whole are directly checked. The gate proves own Shared.runtime.initialState.engine.node equals that same Intake targetPresentation by rfl.",
    "Own Type receipt_compiles and receipt_next reach actual selected debtAdmission and canonical nextBorn. Its environment is write(actual oldPaid+native), equivalently write(original raw at updated input). born_inventory and born_pair_inventory keep exactly the existing Configured.lowProgramme stock callbacks.",
    "Generic write is an arbitrary source encoding operation; its theorem claims Env=write(actual total) and no generic faithfulness. The fixed-R leaf uses the existing Unit constPair writer. F.next_action_source literalRaw and original old_paid_value/source_value recover the actual S(p) pair without recomputing R in the decoder.",
    "The fixed-R native_zero is derived from actual unchanged registered environment and existing residual old_value, not assumed. written_pair and actual_born_pair restore both physical projection and literal physical orthogonal remainder. Original same-source R state2, trace3 and complete raw pair sum are directly consumed by the gate.",
    "For any supplied actual ScalarFrame, the literal constant source(1,0) has own native receipt value0. written_one reads actual born active Env(1,0); a kernel checked control proves its difference from own initial Env0 is nonzero, and actual_receipt_next supplies the canonical next. The constructor has no nonzero or terminal premise.",
    "All fourteen selected raw mathematical ranges are independently byte-identical to the frozen splice after allowed envelope changes. Production has no diagnostics, examples, unauthorized axiom or scratch/Verification import. The three new leaves change no old interface or default, so no unrelated caller refresh is claimed."
  ],
